{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（26日）傍晚6時許，警方接報中環怡和大廈疑有吊船墜下，兩名工人被困大廈外牆，分別位處大約30樓及40樓對開。</p><p>警方及消防正設法營救。</p><p>現場所見，消防「飛將軍」游繩救援，並開氣墊戒備，干諾道中部分行車線封閉。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:20:58.986273+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:30:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:18:11.309231+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T12:18:11.309231+00:00","content_hash":"1c1e1caad524856dc7d5e7828e9d3902adf5768c286e6d027fed217d1228e5f8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}